    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3592e9abddad6bbaf07f2a7f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在受伤后风光地重返赛场的赛马娘\n确实很多。然而，因为负伤而被迫结束\n选手生涯的赛马娘实际上也不在少数。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca04421c5f163575876b083845240960aacb248e74fb57fccaa2c59d83749df7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1012/storytimeline_501012115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
