      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08a0dc52387157dd37b59b73",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尤其是她这次受的伤──右髋关节炎，\n这种病就算治好也有很高的几率会复发。\n实在是很难乐观看待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11f295e73a7c0b03d6f1c02a3dbfe3107a020e54f018aa9304e47dbdf0eca960",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
